<title>Netherlands: FOCUS-Akzo Nobel 1996 profit modestly up.</title>
<headline>FOCUS-Akzo Nobel 1996 profit modestly up.</headline>
<byline>Lien van der Leij</byline>
<dateline>ARNHEM, Netherlands 1997-02-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dutch chemicals group Akzo Nobel NV on Thursday announced a modest rise in 1996 net profits, but raised the annual dividend and forecast higher net income in 1997.</p>
<p>Net profit in 1996 rose to 1.318 billion guilders ($694.2 million) from 1.314 billion in 1995 on turnover of 22.44 billion guilders, increased from 21.49 billion a year earlier.</p>
